#: ../../source/referencia/reliability.rst:2
msgid "Confiabilidad (reliability)"
msgstr "Reliability (reliability)"

#: ../../source/referencia/reliability.rst:4
msgid "Módulo ``walopy.reliability``. Todos los símbolos se importan también desde ``walopy``."
msgstr "Module ``walopy.reliability``. All the symbols are also importable from ``walopy``."

#: ../../source/referencia/reliability.rst:7
msgid "Funciones"
msgstr "Functions"

#: of walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis:1
msgid "Confiabilidad de un componente con distribución exponencial de fallas."
msgstr "Reliability of a component with an exponential failure distribution."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis
#: walopy.reliability.parallel_system walopy.reliability.series_system
#: walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis:3
msgid "Tasa de falla λ (fallas por unidad de tiempo, p. ej. 0.01 fallas/hora)."
msgstr "Failure rate λ (failures per unit of time, e.g. 0.01 failures/hour)."

#: of walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis:5
msgid "Tiempo medio de reparación. Si se indica, calcula la disponibilidad en régimen estacionario."
msgstr "Mean time to repair. If given, the steady-state availability is computed."

#: of walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Tiempo en que se evalúa R(t) = e^{−λt}."
msgstr "Time at which R(t) = e^{−λt} is evaluated."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis
#: walopy.reliability.parallel_system walopy.reliability.series_system
#: walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "Return type"

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis
#: walopy.reliability.parallel_system walopy.reliability.series_system
#: walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "Raises"

#: of walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis:12
msgid "Si algún argumento numérico no es finito o está fuera de su dominio (por ejemplo, no positivo)."
msgstr "If any numeric argument is not finite or is outside its domain (for example, not positive)."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:25 walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis:13
#: walopy.reliability.parallel_system:17 walopy.reliability.series_system:15
#: walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis:14
msgid "Si un argumento no es numérico o una secuencia contiene valores que no lo son."
msgstr "If an argument is not numeric or a sequence contains values that are not."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:28 walopy.reliability.mtbf_analysis:16
#: walopy.reliability.parallel_system:20 walopy.reliability.series_system:18
#: walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis:17
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Examples"

#: of walopy.reliability.series_system:1
msgid "Confiabilidad de un sistema en serie (todos los componentes deben funcionar)."
msgstr "Reliability of a series system (all the components must work)."

#: of walopy.reliability.series_system:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid "R_sys(t) = ∏ e^{−λi·t} = e^{−(Σλi)·t}"
msgstr "R_sys(t) = ∏ e^{−λi·t} = e^{−(Σλi)·t}"

#: of walopy.reliability.parallel_system:7 walopy.reliability.series_system:5
msgid "Tasas de falla λi de los componentes."
msgstr "Failure rates λi of the components."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:17 walopy.reliability.parallel_system:9
#: walopy.reliability.series_system:7
msgid "Tiempo para evaluar R(t)."
msgstr "Time at which to evaluate R(t)."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:19 walopy.reliability.parallel_system:11
#: walopy.reliability.series_system:9
msgid "Tiempo medio de reparación para calcular la disponibilidad."
msgstr "Mean time to repair to compute the availability."

#: of walopy.reliability.parallel_system:16 walopy.reliability.series_system:14
msgid "Si algún argumento numérico no es finito o está fuera de su dominio (por ejemplo, no positivo).     Si ``failure_rates`` está vacío."
msgstr "If any numeric argument is not finite or is outside its domain (for example, not positive).     If ``failure_rates`` is empty."

#: of walopy.reliability.parallel_system:1
msgid "Confiabilidad de un sistema en paralelo (al menos un componente debe funcionar)."
msgstr "Reliability of a parallel system (at least one component must work)."

#: of walopy.reliability.parallel_system:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid "R_sys(t) = 1 − ∏(1 − e^{−λi·t})"
msgstr "R_sys(t) = 1 − ∏(1 − e^{−λi·t})"

#: of walopy.reliability.parallel_system:5
msgid "El MTBF se calcula numéricamente (∫₀^∞ R_sys(t) dt)."
msgstr "The MTBF is computed numerically (∫₀^∞ R_sys(t) dt)."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:1
msgid "Confiabilidad de un sistema k-de-n (funcionan al menos k de n componentes idénticos)."
msgstr "Reliability of a k-out-of-n system (at least k of n identical components work)."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:3
msgid "Todos los componentes son idénticos con tasa de falla λ."
msgstr "All the components are identical with failure rate λ."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:5
#, python-brace-format
msgid "R_sys(t) = Σ_{j=k}^{n} C(n,j) · e^{−jλt} · (1 − e^{−λt})^{n−j}"
msgstr "R_sys(t) = Σ_{j=k}^{n} C(n,j) · e^{−jλt} · (1 − e^{−λt})^{n−j}"

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "MTBF (exacto, exponenciales idénticas): MTBF = (1/λ) · Σ_{j=k}^{n} (−1)^{j−k} · C(n,j) · C(j−1, k−1) · (1/j) que se simplifica a  (1/λ) · Σ_{i=k}^{n} 1/i  para el k-de-n estándar."
msgstr "MTBF (exact, identical exponentials): MTBF = (1/λ) · Σ_{j=k}^{n} (−1)^{j−k} · C(n,j) · C(j−1, k−1) · (1/j) which simplifies to  (1/λ) · Σ_{i=k}^{n} 1/i  for the standard k-out-of-n."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:11
msgid "Número total de componentes."
msgstr "Total number of components."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:13
msgid "Número mínimo de componentes que deben funcionar (1 ≤ k ≤ n)."
msgstr "Minimum number of components that must work (1 ≤ k ≤ n)."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:15
msgid "Tasa de falla λ de los componentes."
msgstr "Failure rate λ of the components."

#: of walopy.reliability.koon_system:24
msgid "Si algún argumento numérico no es finito o está fuera de su dominio (por ejemplo, no positivo).     Si no se cumple 1 ≤ k ≤ n."
msgstr "If any numeric argument is not finite or is outside its domain (for example, not positive).     If 1 ≤ k ≤ n does not hold."

#: of walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis:1
msgid "Ajusta una distribución Weibull de dos parámetros a datos de falla completos."
msgstr "Fits a two-parameter Weibull distribution to complete failure data."

#: of walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis:3
msgid "F(t) = 1 − exp(−(t/η)^β)"
msgstr "F(t) = 1 − exp(−(t/η)^β)"

#: of walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis:5
msgid "Tiempos de falla observados (todos deben ser > 0). Se requieren al menos 2 valores."
msgstr "Observed failure times (all must be > 0). At least 2 values are required."

#: of walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis:7
msgid "``'MLE'`` (por defecto): máxima verosimilitud mediante bisección; ``'RRY'``: regresión de rangos sobre Y (método de papel de probabilidad, más rápido)."
msgstr "``'MLE'`` (default): maximum likelihood by bisection; ``'RRY'``: rank regression on Y (probability-paper method, faster)."

#: of walopy.reliability.weibull_analysis:13
msgid "Si algún argumento numérico no es finito o está fuera de su dominio (por ejemplo, no positivo).     Si hay menos de 2 tiempos de falla, todos son iguales o ``method`` no es ``'MLE'`` ni ``'RRY'``."
msgstr "If any numeric argument is not finite or is outside its domain (for example, not positive).     If there are fewer than 2 failure times, all are equal or ``method`` is neither ``'MLE'`` nor ``'RRY'``."

#: ../../source/referencia/reliability.rst:20
msgid "Clases de resultado"
msgstr "Result classes"

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult:1
msgid "Resultado de confiabilidad de un sistema."
msgstr "Reliability result of a system."

#: ../../source/referencia/reliability.rst
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variables"

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult:3
msgid "``'series'``, ``'parallel'``, ``'k-of-n'`` o ``'component'``."
msgstr "``'series'``, ``'parallel'``, ``'k-of-n'`` or ``'component'``."

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult:5
msgid "Número de componentes del sistema."
msgstr "Number of components of the system."

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult:7
msgid "Tasas de falla individuales λi de los componentes (fallas/unidad de tiempo)."
msgstr "Individual failure rates λi of the components (failures/unit of time)."

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult:9
msgid "Tiempo medio entre fallas del sistema."
msgstr "Mean time between failures of the system."

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult:11
msgid "Tiempo en que se evaluó R(t) (si se indicó)."
msgstr "Time at which R(t) was evaluated (if given)."

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult:13
msgid "Confiabilidad del sistema R(t) en el t pedido."
msgstr "System reliability R(t) at the requested t."

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult:15
msgid "Disponibilidad en régimen estacionario A = MTBF / (MTBF + MTTR), si se indicó mttr."
msgstr "Steady-state availability A = MTBF / (MTBF + MTTR), if mttr was given."

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult:17
msgid "Tiempo medio de reparación, si se indicó."
msgstr "Mean time to repair, if given."

#: of walopy.reliability.ReliabilityResult.R:1
msgid "Calcula la confiabilidad R(t) del sistema con la topología almacenada."
msgstr "Computes the reliability R(t) of the system with the stored topology."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult:1
msgid "Resultado del análisis Weibull de dos parámetros."
msgstr "Result of the two-parameter Weibull analysis."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult:3
msgid "La FDA es F(t) = 1 − exp(−(t/η)^β)."
msgstr "The CDF is F(t) = 1 − exp(−(t/η)^β)."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult:5
msgid "Parámetro de forma β. β < 1 → tasa de falla decreciente (mortalidad infantil). β = 1 → tasa de falla constante (modelo exponencial). β > 1 → tasa de falla creciente (desgaste)."
msgstr "Shape parameter β. β < 1 → decreasing failure rate (infant mortality). β = 1 → constant failure rate (exponential model). β > 1 → increasing failure rate (wear-out)."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult:10
msgid "Parámetro de escala η (vida característica); F(η) ≈ 63.2 %."
msgstr "Scale parameter η (characteristic life); F(η) ≈ 63.2 %."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult:12
msgid "Tiempo medio hasta la falla = η · Γ(1 + 1/β)."
msgstr "Mean time to failure = η · Γ(1 + 1/β)."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult:14
#, python-format
msgid "Vida B10: tiempo en el que ha fallado el 10 % de la población."
msgstr "B10 life: time at which 10 % of the population has failed."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult:16
msgid "Vida mediana (50 % ha fallado)."
msgstr "Median life (50 % have failed)."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult:18
msgid "Método de estimación: ``'MLE'`` (máxima verosimilitud) o ``'RRY'`` (regresión de rangos sobre Y / papel de probabilidad)."
msgstr "Estimation method: ``'MLE'`` (maximum likelihood) or ``'RRY'`` (rank regression on Y / probability paper)."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult:21
msgid "Número de tiempos de falla utilizados."
msgstr "Number of failure times used."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult.R:1
msgid "Confiabilidad en el tiempo *t*: R(t) = exp(−(t/η)^β)."
msgstr "Reliability at time *t*: R(t) = exp(−(t/η)^β)."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult.F:1
msgid "No confiabilidad (FDA) en el tiempo *t*: F(t) = 1 − R(t)."
msgstr "Unreliability (CDF) at time *t*: F(t) = 1 − R(t)."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult.h:1
msgid "Tasa de falla instantánea: h(t) = (β/η)·(t/η)^(β−1)."
msgstr "Instantaneous failure rate: h(t) = (β/η)·(t/η)^(β−1)."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult.b_life:1
msgid "Tiempo en el que ha fallado el porcentaje *pct* de la población."
msgstr "Time at which the percentage *pct* of the population has failed."

#: of walopy.reliability.WeibullResult.b_life:3
msgid "Por ejemplo, ``b_life(10)`` devuelve la vida B10."
msgstr "For example, ``b_life(10)`` returns the B10 life."

